    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head>Geþyn. 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And se ðe swa geþogene forwyrhtan næfde, swore for silfne æfter his rihte, oððe his þolode.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who had no such distinguished representative, swore in person to obtain his rights, or lost his case.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 se þe swa geþogenne forwyrhtan næfde, swore for sylfne æfter his rihte, oððe his þolode.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And he who did not have such a worthy representative swore for himself to his rights or forfeited his case.</ab>
      </div>
